#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Composition.rst:57
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Composition.rst:232
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Composition.rst:300
msgid "In the first shell, start the component container:"
